            If adding a new person, First Name and Last Name are required. 
            Taxid is not required, however a duplicate tax id number will raise an exception - Another Person with the given Tax ID number already exists in the database. 
            All person records are created as valid with the information on hand, regardless of DNA established validation rules.
            If maintaining an existing person, persnbr is required. First Name and Last Name are also required however a match is not done, 
            meaning if you pass a different first or last name the database will get updated with the different information. 
            Taxid is not required when updating a person, however if you pass one in the request, it will search the database to make sure there are no other person records with the same taxid. 
            If a person is located (other than the provided persnbr) it will also raise the exception above.
